# S11 — /zcash asset snapshot (live-e2e Phase 1 scenario 11, M1-546).
#
# The reply names its data source and includes the source URL bare (per-source
# ToS attribution; CLAUDE.md §Asset commands). The snapshot needs the public
# price endpoint reachable from the host.

send dm admin /zcash
expect regex 120000 (?s)source:.*https?://
